					"id": 700670301,
					"content": "別過來！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "維特魯威"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670302,
					"content": "#在這裡想自己墓誌銘要寫什麼實在太奢侈了。不怕{F#妳}{M#你}們笑話，我已經想好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "維特魯威"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670303,
					"content": "「請把我的愛轉交給帕特拉衛城的——」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "維特魯威"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670304,
					"content": "維特魯威！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670305,
					"content": "沒說完就沙化了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "彩特琳德"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670306,
					"content": "完了，我在這個悲傷的時刻很想笑，真不知道沙化解除之後他會不會害羞得想死。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "維尼皮"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670307,
					"content": "您真樂觀。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700670308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "彩特琳德"
				},
				{
					"id": 700670308,
					"content": "現在是先處理那個守衛，還是爭分奪秒搜索倖存者，我們要做出選擇了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "維尼皮"
				}
			]
		},
		{
